 -screening-21-nov-2026\n\nThe premiere of Baon: Stories and Struggles of 
 Filipino Migrants\, directed by Rachel Bundoc Lucero and produced by Rach
 el Bundoc Lucero and Kaycie Luna\, screens at SFMOMA. In the film\, host 
 and activist Rachel Lucero (The Sago Show) goes into the kitchen with mig
 rant Filipinos in the San Francisco Bay Area to share meals that remind t
 hem of home\, hearing their experiences of struggling for change—
